# Netlify headers — always serve the freshest page.
#
# The browser must revalidate the HTML on every load instead of reusing a stale
# cached copy. This is what guarantees every browser runs the current sync code
# (not an old version), and it complements the no-cache <meta> tags inside the
# HTML. The wallpaper images themselves are served from Supabase, not Netlify,
# so this only affects the page files.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
